## Project Objectives

Development of an integrated autonomous mining system combining AI-powered fleet management, predictive maintenance, and safety monitoring for open-pit and underground mining operations.

### Key Deliverables
1. Autonomous haul truck control system
2. Fleet optimization platform
3. Predictive maintenance system
4. Safety and collision avoidance
5. Mine planning integration

